\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Summary of the two vibrational states identified for $^{88}\text {Sr}$, comparing measured line centers and linewidths to the literature values from Zelevinsky et al.~\cite {zelevinsky_narrow_2006}. $\Gamma _0$ and $\Gamma _{\text {thermal}}$ are estimated from first principles (not extracted from the data). Uncertainties are estimated as described in Sec.~\ref {sec:uncertainties}. \textsuperscript {*}Intensity during the PA pulses: the $\nu =-1$ spectrum was recorded with the ODT/PA chopping sequence (Fig.~\ref {fig:sequence_chopping}, $50\%$ duty cycle), i.e. a time-averaged intensity of $4\pm 1$~mW/cm$^2$.}}{101}{table.caption.284}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Comparison of the photoassociation line of the bound state $\nu =-1$ measured with two different laser sources. The excess width is obtained by subtracting in quadrature the natural and thermal widths from the measured one, $\sqrt {\Gamma _{\text {tot}}^2-(\Gamma _0/2\pi )^2-\Gamma _{\text {thermal}}^2}$; it gives an order of magnitude of the technical broadening.}}{104}{table.caption.287}%
